{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019QrfEhBcVwLySusGAfLNz2","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tstatic bool access_gic_sgi(struct kvm_vcpu *vcpu,\n2\t\t\t\t   struct sys_reg_params *p,\n3\t\t\t\t   const struct sys_reg_desc *r)\n4\t{\n5\t\tbool g1;\n6\t\n7\t\tif (!p->is_write)\n8\t\t\treturn read_from_write_only(vcpu, p, r);\n9\t\n10\t\t/*\n11\t\t * In a system where GICD_CTLR.DS=1, a ICC_SGI0R_EL1 access generates\n12\t\t * Group0 SGIs only, while ICC_SGI1R_EL1 can generate either group,\n13\t\t * depending on the SGI configuration. ICC_ASGI1R_EL1 is effectively\n14\t\t * equivalent to ICC_SGI0R_EL1, as there is no \"alternative\" secure\n15\t\t * group.\n16\t\t */\n17\t\tif (p->Op0 == 0) {\t\t/* AArch32 */\n18\t\t\tswitch (p->Op1) {\n19\t\t\tdefault:\t\t/* Keep GCC quiet */\n20\t\t\tcase 0:\t\t\t/* ICC_SGI1R */\n21\t\t\t\tg1 = true;\n22\t\t\t\tbreak;\n23\t\t\tcase 1:\t\t\t/* ICC_ASGI1R */\n24\t\t\tcase 2:\t\t\t/* ICC_SGI0R */\n25\t\t\t\tg1 = false;\n26\t\t\t\tbreak;\n27\t\t\t}\n28\t\t} else {\t\t\t/* AArch64 */\n29\t\t\tswitch (p->Op2) {\n30\t\t\tdefault:\t\t/* Keep GCC quiet */\n31\t\t\tcase 5:\t\t\t/* ICC_SGI1R_EL1 */\n32\t\t\t\tg1 = true;\n33\t\t\t\tbreak;\n34\t\t\tcase 6:\t\t\t/* ICC_ASGI1R_EL1 */\n35\t\t\tcase 7:\t\t\t/* ICC_SGI0R_EL1 */\n36\t\t\t\tg1 = false;\n37\t\t\t\tbreak;\n38\t\t\t}\n39\t\t}\n40\t\n41\t\tvgic_v3_dispatch_sgi(vcpu, p->regval, g1);\n42\t\n43\t\treturn true;\n44\t}\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cc4895b6-b99c-44db-889b-48f5c9c8d361","uuid":"a8756a7c-b25b-4087-96bd-89f4b8fcdf68","timestamp":"2026-11-20T00:24:15.733Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/yangkaiyan/Desktop/EECS4080/blind-run/samples/s147.c","content":"static bool access_gic_sgi(struct kvm_vcpu *vcpu,\n\t\t\t   struct sys_reg_params *p,\n\t\t\t   const struct sys_reg_desc *r)\n{\n\tbool g1;\n\n\tif (!p->is_write)\n\t\treturn read_from_write_only(vcpu, p, r);\n\n\t/*\n\t * In a system where GICD_CT